{"id":"n82273-4-5","stage":4,"title":"툭툭 · 一直绊倒脚或被踢到的声音","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82273-4-5-1","ko":"운동장에 돌멩이가 참 많구나.","zh":"操场上的小石子真多。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동장에","meaning":"运动场，体育场","explanation":"운동장：运动场，体育场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"운동장","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26891","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동장에","audio":"/audio/8fc031b87768c1eb385d.mp3"}},{"text":"돌멩이가","meaning":"小石头，石子儿","explanation":"돌멩이：小石头，石子儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돌멩이","audio":"/audio/4b800a0017023fb89fab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14791","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌멩이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌멩이가","audio":"/audio/8975a62ec8212f965b7a.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"많구나.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많구나","audio":"/audio/aa53bcae8325514f6f9e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"899e5787d5587fd1","term":"운동장","zh":"运动场，体育场","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3","entryId":"26891","definition":"为能够进行体育比赛、游玩等而设有多种器具或设施的宽阔场所。","pronunciation":["운ː동장"]},{"id":"4b800a0017023fb8","term":"돌멩이","zh":"小石头，石子儿","audio":"/audio/4b800a0017023fb89fab.mp3","entryId":"14791","definition":"大小可以攥在手里的石头。","pronunciation":["돌ː멩이"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背